.mb-3
    label(translate) Kubeconfig
    input.form-control(
        type='text',
        placeholder='$KUBECONFIG or ~/.kube/config',
        [(ngModel)]='profile.options.kubeconfig',
        (change)='loadContexts()',
    )
    small.text-muted(translate) Contexts of the default kubeconfig are listed as profiles already; set a file here for clusters from another one.

.row
    .col-6
        .mb-3
            label(translate) Context
            input.form-control(
                type='text',
                alwaysVisibleTypeahead,
                placeholder='current-context',
                [(ngModel)]='profile.options.context',
                [ngbTypeahead]='contextsAutocomplete',
            )
    .col-6
        .mb-3
            label(translate) Namespace
            input.form-control(
                type='text',
                placeholder='All namespaces',
                [(ngModel)]='profile.options.namespace',
            )

h4.mt-4(translate) Node shells
.row
    .col-6
        .mb-3
            label(translate) Image
            input.form-control(
                type='text',
                placeholder='alpine:3.20',
                [(ngModel)]='profile.options.nodeShellImage',
            )
            small.text-muted(translate) Any image with nsenter, which Alpine's and BusyBox's have
    .col-6
        .mb-3
            label(translate) Namespace
            input.form-control(
                type='text',
                placeholder='kube-system',
                [(ngModel)]='profile.options.nodeShellNamespace',
            )
            small.text-muted(translate) Has to allow privileged pods
